Inclusion Criteria:

* Age ≥ 25 years and ≤ 65 years;
* Solid organ transplantation (liver, kidney, heart, or lung) performed at least 1 year prior to enrollment, with good graft functional recovery according to organ-specific criteria;
* Ability to understand and independently complete questionnaires;
* Ability to provide written informed consent;
* Absence of clinical contraindications to therapeutic exercise;
* Adequate cognitive status;
* SF-36 score \< 50 or Distress Thermometer (DT) score ≥ 4 and Pittsburgh Sleep Quality Index (PSQI) score ≥ 5.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Diagnosis of severe cognitive impairment, acute psychiatric illness, or significant hearing or visual disability;
* Severe ongoing complications or comorbidities that would prevent participation in the physiotherapy program;
* Unstable immunosuppressive therapy and/or evidence of ongoing graft rejection;
* Diagnosis of active malignancy;
* Pregnancy.
